<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103790" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆλε</span></b> , 
			Boeot.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πειλε-</span></b>  in pr. names, Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλοῦ</span>
			 (q.v.), <i>at a distance, far off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.190
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.183
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.312
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάλα τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				1015
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. πρὸς δυσμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					232
				</span></i>
			 (troch.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to a distance, afar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆλε δὲ χαλκὸς λάμπε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.153
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. βάλε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.482
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. πεσόντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.395
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾤχετο τ. διὰ προμάχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.358
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>far from</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. φίλων καὶ
				πατρίδος αἴης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				817
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.539
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. δ᾽ ἀπεπλάγχθη σάκεος δόρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.291
				</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.333
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.354
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. δ᾽ ἀπ᾽ αὐτοῦ κάππεσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.880
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.117
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.301
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.315
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				275
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆλ᾽ ἐξ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.863
				</span></i>
			.--
				Ep.
			 word, used once by <i><span class="en">Pi.,
					<u>P.</u>11.23</span></i>, and
			once in Trag. (<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> l.c.); never in Prose, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τηλαυγής</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
